(text "Ocarina pitch and breath-pressure logger" (at 30 160.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 66db0ebc-6d8d-486b-9245-275c76d088cd))
(text "U3 measures mouthpiece pressure through a sealed silicone tube (2 mm ID) on the mouthpiece port." (at 30 164.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 41edb952-4161-449f-8c44-c848f7e812b4))
(text "R1/R2 scale 0.5-4.5 V sensor output to 0.33-3.0 V for the Pico ADC. C1 filters (about 240 Hz)." (at 30 169.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8bbf14e1-3089-4a8c-ae34-8e623ea6d2b6))
(text "I2S uses PIO: LRCLK must be BCLK+1 (GP10/GP11). INMP441 L/R tied to GND = left channel." (at 30 173.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b3611df0-99c9-4b6e-8c5f-4c2c8da36aae))
(text "SW1 uses the Pico internal pull-up. Pico and modules powered from USB (VBUS = 5 V)." (at 30 178.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 88120dbb-2751-4f96-b393-44f21744fc4b))
(text "Module pin numbers vary by seller: wire by pin name, not number." (at 30 182.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2251ea4a-d0d4-4e78-9d96-61d405c8b5d4))
